WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:15.916
"I can't wait to fly in an airplane!" Harry said.

2
00:00:15.917 --> 00:00:20.462
"Flying sounds scary," Oliver said.

3
00:00:20.463 --> 00:00:24.450
"It will be fun!" Dad said.

4
00:00:24.451 --> 00:00:30.367
Lots of people got on the plane.

5
00:00:30.368 --> 00:00:36.693
"We might be too heavy for the plane," Oliver said.

6
00:00:36.694 --> 00:00:41.245
"We are not too heavy," Mom said.

7
00:00:41.246 --> 00:00:45.957
The plane took off.

8
00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:52.220
The Carter Family was flying!

9
00:00:52.221 --> 00:00:56.188
"My ears hurt!" Oliver said.

10
00:00:56.189 --> 00:01:02.491
Mom gave Oliver a piece of gum.

11
00:01:02.492 --> 00:01:08.160
Chewing the gum made his ears feel better.

12
00:01:08.161 --> 00:01:14.513
Oliver looked out the window.

13
00:01:14.514 --> 00:01:18.914
"We are very high up!" he said.

14
00:01:18.915 --> 00:01:21.974
"What if we fall?"

15
00:01:21.975 --> 00:01:30.954
Harry said, "We will not fall."

16
00:01:30.955 --> 00:01:41.929
Mom gave the kids a card game.

17
00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:50.908
"Oliver can go first," Emmy said.

18
00:01:50.909 --> 00:01:54.227
Oliver won the game.

19
00:01:54.228 --> 00:01:58.074
"That was fun," he said.

20
00:01:58.075 --> 00:02:04.547
A flight attendant brought drinks and a snack.

21
00:02:04.548 --> 00:02:08.909
"Yum," said Oliver.

22
00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:13.495
"I love pretzels and juice."

23
00:02:13.496 --> 00:02:17.111
The plane landed.

24
00:02:17.112 --> 00:02:21.686
Everyone got their luggage.

25
00:02:21.687 --> 00:02:27.572
The flight attendant smiled at Oliver.

26
00:02:27.573 --> 00:02:31.312
"Would you like to meet the pilot?" she asked.

27
00:02:31.313 --> 00:02:35.347
"Yes!" Oliver said.

28
00:02:35.348 --> 00:02:38.846
The pilot had a cool uniform.

29
00:02:38.847 --> 00:02:42.581
He showed Oliver the cockpit.

30
00:02:42.582 --> 00:02:47.263
Oliver saw buttons and lights and maps.

31
00:02:47.264 --> 00:02:53.093
"Wow!" Oliver said.

32
00:02:53.094 --> 00:02:58.148
"Does flying still seem scary, Oliver?" Dad asked.

33
00:02:58.149 --> 00:03:01.846
"Scary?" Oliver laughed.

34
00:03:01.847 --> 00:03:05.481
"Flying is not scary, Dad!

35
00:03:05.482 --> 00:03:13.691
Flying is awesome!"
